            and revolves around software. From distributed backends all the way to manual memory allocation, I'm very
            versatile and I adapt quickly to all sorts of contexts.
        </p>

        <p>
            I have a special interest for technology that brings a direct and positive impact on societies, the
            environment and people's quality of life. I pay special attention to craftsmanship, quality and the
            long-term sustainability of my solutions.
        </p>

        <p>
            If I'm not coding, you can probably find me fiddling around with my servers, playing FFXIV or writing
            shitposts on bluesky.
        </p>

